flowchart TB
    D[DEFINE] --> S1[Strategy: problem & outcome]
    D --> P1[Portfolio: investment themes]
    D --> G1[Program: outcome & benefits]
    D --> J1[Project: charter & scope]
    M[MEASURE] --> S2[Strategy: capability baseline]
    M --> P2[Portfolio: spend/capacity]
    M --> G2[Program: benefit baseline]
    M --> J2[Project: process/service baseline]
    A[ANALYSE] --> S3[Strategy: gaps & causes]
    A --> P3[Portfolio: duplication/concentration]
    A --> G3[Program: dependencies/root causes]
    A --> J3[Project: requirements/risk]
    I[IMPROVE] --> S4[Strategy: target state]
    I --> P4[Portfolio: fund/defer/stop]
    I --> G4[Program: coordinated change]
    I --> J4[Project: solution/delivery]
    C[CONTROL] --> S5[Strategy: KPIs/review]
    C --> P5[Portfolio: benefits review]
    C --> G5[Program: benefit realisation]
    C --> J5[Project: BAU/control plan]
